{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"stub\":true,\"stub_explanation\":\"No supported vulnerability found. Inherited approve always calls _requireOwned before authorization, event emission, or approval storage writes. Unminted and burned tickets have zero ownership and revert with ERC721NonexistentToken. Burns clear prior approvals, and Raffle's retained historical ticket ranges do not bypass this check.\",\"results\":[]}"}}
